  "privacy.title": "Privacy",
  "privacy.label": "pktito's privacy terms",
  "privacy.intro": "pktito is local transcription software — it turns speech into text on this computer. Your media files are not uploaded to cloud servers, and pktito has no accounts, ads or tracking.",
  "privacy.internet": "What reaches the internet",
  "privacy.download_html": "<b>Downloading a model.</b> pktito downloads AI models from models.pktito.net, hosted on a content delivery network. The server logs your IP address, the time, the file requested and a standard user-agent string, but no name, account or device identifier. These logs are used to keep the service secure and to count downloads in aggregate. We don't use them to identify you, combine them with other data, or sell or share them.",
  "privacy.links_html": "<b>Links.</b> Links in pktito open in your browser, and each site's own privacy policy applies there.",
